  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CoS Refugees Ken 2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SvK Flykting Ken 2011 -2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet avser fr&#xe4;mja generella v&#xe4;lbefinnandet + r&#xe4;tten till ett    v&#xe4;rdig liv hos Somaliska flyktingar i 2 l&#xe4;ger i Kenya. Huvudsakliga   st&#xf6;domr&#xe5;den i Kakuma &#xe4;r s&#xe4;kerhetsfr&#xe5;gor, ledarskap bland flyktingarna i l&#xe4;gret, samt aktiviteter f&#xf6;r unga; och  i Dadaab fr&#xe4;mst planeringen av flyktingl&#xe4;grets struktur, s&#xe4;kerhetsfr&#xe5;gor och assistans till       nyinkomna flyktingar. &#xc4;ven host community f&#xe5;r st&#xf6;d-tillg&#xe5;ng till H20.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The prog intends to promote well-being and right to decent life among Somali refugees in 2 camps in Kenya. main areas of support in Kakuma  include security, leadership among refugees, as well as activites for the young; while in Dadaab primarily camp management, security and    assistance to newly arrived refugees. Host community is also support  through access to water and income generation support.</narrative>
  </description>
